{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">TVB《非份之罪》報捷，收視穩步上揚，上周最高收視錄得 22.6 點（146 萬觀眾），成為上周最高收視節目，成績斐然。該劇自播出以來備受觀眾關注，配合演員落力演出，引起網上討論。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">一眾演員22日下午齊集荃灣為劇集宣傳，單元三《一億殺機》的陳煒、徐榮、林秀怡親臨現場公布收視佳績，和現場觀眾一同慶賀，期望收視節節上升。單元五《骯髒的子彈》及單元六《恐怖情人》的演員亦分別向現場觀眾推介劇情，播放精彩預告片段之餘，更分享拍攝感受及大玩趣味劇情互動遊戲，吸引大批市民圍觀，場面墟冚。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5e9984b9-45c5-4a62-92e5-4ed28972dfcd.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026GnQaLcay7t1784776060.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5e9984b9-45c5-4a62-92e5-4ed28972dfcd.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">當日出席人包括：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">陳煒、劉佩玥、徐榮、林秀怡、阮浩棕、譚凱琪、何沛珈、鄭子誠、江欣燕、張彥博、何啟南、黎燕珊、翟威廉、鬼塚、嘉駿、李啟傑、梁皓楷及監製王心慰</span><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T08:20:07.340864+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}